---
title: Brian's Mulled Cider
image: https://myincrediblerecipes.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/IMG_9951.jpg
---

In a #30 gallon percolator basket{}, put @apple juice{1%gallon}, @orange juice concentrate{1/2%can}(frozen), @cranberry juice{1/2%gallon}, @brown sugar{1/4%cup}, @cloves{1%tsp}(whole), @cinnamon{4%sticks}, @nutmeg{1/4%tsp}, up to the fill line. Percolate the full cycle.

Add a splash of @?dark rum{}(not spiced, i.e. Cruzan) when serving.